  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You sold me dust",
          "rhyme": "9st",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Get him!",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Great balls of fire",
          "rhyme": "iR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Guess who just crawled out the muck and mire",
          "rhyme": "iR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "That could make you trust a motherfuckin' liar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "A real shuck and jiver",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Vaughn never been a duck-and-diver",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He spit on the mic, yuck, saliva",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Hold it like a truck driver hold a CB on a sharp turn",
          "rhyme": "9Rn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Still clutchin' his chest from the heartburn",
          "rhyme": "9Rn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "What's your handle? I need a Zantac, ahk",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "And thanks before I blank into anaphylactic shock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Rock or disco, chocolate on a Crisco ho",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Cock diesel and still tell a joke like Joe Piscopo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Tell 'em the basics, basically, break the matrix",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "And just for kicks, make 'em gel like Asics",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "That's why they actin' standoffish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Eat the beat by hand like canned raw crawfish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Can you please pass the cocktail sauce?",
          "rhyme": "os",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "You might as well know, Hell is hot as hell, boss",
          "rhyme": "Os",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Tell my hoss, he said broads call me Vaughny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I make sure I throws 'em back if they's too scrawny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Or bony, phony MCs use a stand-in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Leave him hangin' like if I ain't know where his hands been",
          "rhyme": ")n",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Hussy, how 'bout we bloody up you just for me?",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Bust a knee, then go finish study, a plus degree",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "True victory, a new sick story",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "I never met a chick that was too thick for me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Holy Moses, my old earth know me closest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "On how I played the back and stayed bent like scoliosis",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "It's no puzzle, you can ask Doc Zizmor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "The slow guzzle got your nizzle crooked like Biz jaw",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Drink like a fishy, she wish she was a Pisces",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Live since back when twenty-five cents Icees",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Used to turn your tongue the color red",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Now they want to fill ya full of lead",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "What the fuck that young fella said?",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "What, kid? It's Vaughn, the red-blooded",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Do yourself a favor or come on, get head-butted",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Yoke him if he run, I'll be there in a jiffy, son",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "With the flame suppressor like off the 151",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Quit your bitchin' or get blaow in your babble-box",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Punishment for dry snitchin', now eat this Travel Fox",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "You'll be alright once it pass through your yellow belly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Only thing he said was, \"Can you please pass the jelly?\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Homo say what? Like a promo, play the cut",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "On the late night, before you touch the mic, get your weight right",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "A lot of crews like to act like a violent mob",
          "rhyme": "Ob",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "They really need to just shut the fuck up like Silent Bob",
          "rhyme": "Ob",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Either that or get smoked like hickory",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Should squash the beef and go wash their teeth quickly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "Know the stee', write a rhyme like a mystery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "And sign it on the bottom in calligraphy, \"Your nigga, V\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCCDEEFGHHIFJJKLIIMNOCIOPQRHQICSSCCTUVVIIWXYYIIIC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCCBDDAEFFAAAAFEAAAGHCAHIAEFAACIICCJBEEAAKBEEAAAC"
    }
  ]
